## Configuration

### Enable/Disable Tab Completions

```json
{
  // Enable or disable all tab completions
  "editor.tabAutocompletion": true,
  
  // Enable tab completions only when a completion is actively shown
  "editor.tabAutocompletion.enabled": true,
  
  // Show completions immediately (without waiting)
  "editor.tabAutocompletion.showImmediately": false
}
```

### Model-Specific Settings

```json
{
  // Control which model powers Tab completions
  "cursor.agent.tabModel": "claude-haiku-3-5",
  
  // Set a custom base URL for Tab completions (local models)
  "cursor.agent.tabBaseUrl": "http://localhost:11434/v1",
  
  // Temperature for completion generation
  "cursor.agent.tabTemperature": 0.2,
  
  // Maximum completion length in tokens
  "cursor.agent.tabMaxTokens": 64
}
```

### Filtering Settings

```json
{
  // Exclude certain file types from Tab completions
  "editor.tabAutocompletion.excludeFileTypes": [
    "*.log",
    "*.min.js",
    "*.css.map"
  ],
  
  // Minimum characters before completions appear
  "editor.tabAutocompletion.minInputLength": 2,
  
  // Debounce time before generating completions (ms)
  "editor.tabAutocompletion.debounce": 150
}
```

### Provider Configuration

| Setting | Description | Example Values |
|---------|-------------|----------------|
| `cursor.agent.tabProvider` | Provider for Tab completions | `anthropic`, `openai`, `custom` |
| `cursor.agent.tabModel` | Model ID for Tab completions | `claude-haiku-3-5`, `gpt-3.5-turbo` |
| `cursor.agent.tabBaseUrl` | Custom API endpoint | `http://localhost:11434/v1` |
| `cursor.agent.tabApiKey` | API key for Tab provider | (stored encrypted) |

